entist or Postdoctoral Associate in Computational Immunology Pathology Department of Pathology, YSM 01-Sep-2026 Assistant/Associate Professor, Neuro-Urologist Urology New Haven, CT 31-Aug-2026 Assistant Professor, Economics Economics New Haven, CT 31-Aug-2026 Postdoctoral Fellow/Research Associate — Yale School of Medicine, Department of Infectious Disease Infectious Diseases New Haven, CT (work travel expected to AL) 28-Aug-2026 Assistant or Associate Professor - Child Abuse Pediatrician Child Safety, Advocacy & Healing New Haven, CT 26-Aug-2026 Assistant/Associate/Full Professor, Mathematics Mathematics New Haven, CT 26-Aug-2026 Associate Professor/Professor- Director of the MEG Center- VA CT Healthcare Psychiatry West Haven, CT 26-Aug-2026 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9 … next › last » View All Yale Accessibility at Yale · Privacy policy Copyright © 2026 Yale University · All rights reserved Accessibility at Yale · Privacy policy Copyright © 2026 Yale University · All rights reserved If you have questions regarding the site, send a message to faculty.admin@yale.edu Yale University posts its Labor Condition Application (LCA) notices for non-immigrant workers on this site, which is accessible to all. Professional Conduct Review for New Faculty Hires The final candidate, upon acceptance of a contingent offer of employment/faculty appointment, may be required to disclose whether they are, or have been, the subject of any disciplinary proceeding (investigation, hearing, etc.) at previous institutions or employers, and may also be subject to a background screening. Candidates who materially misrepresent information on their resume or other application materials are ineligible for hire/appointment. Final candidates may also be required to sign a release to allow Yale to solicit information regarding any substantiated conduct violations from current and/or past employers. Equal Opportunity and Nondiscrimination Statement The University is committed to basing judgments concerning the admission, education, and employment of individuals upon their qualifications and abilities and seeks to attract to its faculty, staff, and student body qualified persons from a broad range of backgrounds and perspectives. Additionally, in accordance with this Policy and as delineated by federal and Connecticut law, Yale does not discriminate in admissions, educational programs, or employment against any individual on account of that individual’s sex; sexual orientation; gender identity or expression; pregnancy, childbirth or related conditions; race; color; national or ethnic origin; religion; age; disability; protected veteran status, or other protected classes as set forth in federal and Connecticut law. Wage range information"
    },
    "https://your.yale.edu/work-yale/careers": {
      "title": "Careers",
      "description": "Careers at Yale University | Yale University jobs Search results Careers at Yale Current Yale Staff: Explore Internal Opportunities Faculty and Academic Positions: Visit the Yale Interfolio Website Find your fit! Add your skills and interests to receive job offers! Discover how you can make a meaningful impact and explore our extensive career paths and opportunities around every corner. Explore Careers and Resources Learn more Internal Applicants Academic and Faculty Positions New Haven Hiring Initiative Applicant Support A sense of mutual respect and mindfulness permeates our culture-in fact, it’s the key to our success. Learn more Opportunity Around Every Corner Yale offers traditional and signature benefits, generous paid time off, and WorkLife resources. Review offerings to see how benefits support you in leading a more balanced personal and professional life. widget link Meaningful Work We’re shaping the future for generations to come. Explore career opportunities to join our mission . Learn more Accomplished Colleagues Our employees drive innovation and  transformation. Meet our staff and see why Yale is an exceptional workplace . Learn more Community We believe in the power of co nnection. From family-friendly activities to long-lasting community partnerships, we help you stay engaged. Learn more Vibrant Hometown New Haven perfectly blends urban enrgy with small-town charm. Explore renowned shops, theaters, museums, and restaurants. Learn more Benefits and Balance We offer generous benefits , paid time off , and Work + Life resources . Experience how Yale  helps you achieve more balance. Learn more Learning and Growth Explore thousands of learning opportunities for professional development and personal enrichment for all community members. Learn more A sense of mutual respect and mindfulness permeates our culture-in fact, it’s the key to our success. Learn more Benefits Around Every Corner Our benefits help you to find balance between work and life. button Paid Time Off Rest and recharge with 15 holidays and recess days, plus vacation and sick time. Explore about family life Family Support Ten days of backup care ensure your family is covered, along with college coaching and childcare support benefits. Explore about Work life balance Retirement Planning An award-winning retirement program supports you with generous contributions for faculty and staff. Explore about Rewards Homeownership Join 1,000+ staff who became homeowners  through Yale's Homebuyer Program. Explore about Rewards Educational Rewards Recieve support for your child's college tuition (over $15M in scholarships awarded last year) and funds for your own education. Explore about Rewards Staying Well Access balanced support with onsite EAP, 24/7 therapist, self-care app, fitness facility, and Being Well at Yale Programs. Explore about Rewards A sense of mutual respect and mindfulness permeates our culture-in fact, it’s the key to our success. Learn more Be a Part of Something Meaningful Explore a world of opportunities at Yale when you engage in meaningful work, connect with accomplished colleagues, experience integrated learning, enjoy exceptional benefits, and contribute to a vibrant community. Your search could be the start of an outstanding career at Yale. Applicant Support Resources Disable Audio Description Enable Audio Description Transcript Learn more Disable Audio Description Enable Audio Description Transcript Learn more Disable Audio Description Enable Audio Description Transcript Learn more Disable Audio Description Enable Audio Description Transcript Learn more A sense of mutual respect and mindfulness permeates our culture-in fact, it’s the key to our success. Learn more Heading Learn more Join Our Talent Community EXCLUSIVE ACCESS TO JOB OPENINGS, NETWORKING EVENTS AND CAREER RESOURCES Whether you're an experienced professional or just starting, Yale is committed to providing an inclusive environment where you can thrive. Take the first step towards a rewarding career with early access to resources and opportunities designed to support your unique journey. Join Now A sense of mutual respect and mindfulness permeates our culture-in fact, it’s the key to our success. Learn more Widget heading Widget link #3 America's Best-in-State Employers Forbes 2024, Employer of Choice Awards #88 100 Best Adoption-Friendly Workplaces Dave Thomas Foundation 2024, Employer of Choice Awards A sense of mutual respect and mindfulness permeates our culture-in fact, it’s the key to our success. Learn more Tour Our Campus Learn more In Person Considering a creeer at Yale? Start by taking a student-led tour of our campus, to learn about our 300-year history and architecture. Learn more Virtual Can't get to campus? Take one of our several virtual tours to catch a glimpse of cour campus, science and engineering spaces, and more. Learn more Online Enjoy additional tour on subjects including architecture, public art, sustainability, and women at Yale. Learn more In Person Take a student-led tour of our campus and learn about our 300-year history and impact. Learn more Virtual Can't visit in person? Immerse yourself in many virtual tours to catch glimpses of campus life, innovative spaces, and more. Learn more More to Explore Enjoy photo tours of our architecture , public art , sustainability , and other e xperiences Yale has to offer. Learn more A sense of mutual respect and mindfulness permeates our culture-in fact, it’s the key to our success. Learn more Personal Information Career Site Cookie Settings 200 Gibraltar Road Suite 315, Horsham, PA 19044 TEL: 888-985-7755 follow us Inquiries concerning Yale’s Policy Against Discrimination and Harassment may be referred to the Office of Institutional Equity and Accessibility (OIEA). Labor Condition Application Notices Yale University posts its Labor Condition Application (LCA) notices for non-immigrant workers on The Office of International Students & Scholars website. Copyright © 2026 Yale University 2449b5bf6f7e4f4c9d06b392278959fc"
